==============================================================================
S653 Basel-type pi identities: power sums, disjoint sums, Bernoulli sieve
==============================================================================

Core carrier identities
  sin(pi*x)/(pi*x) = product_{n>=1} (1 - x^2/n^2)
  zeta({2}^m)      = pi^(2m)/(2m+1)!        [elementary/disjoint face]
  zeta(2k)         = c_k * pi^(2k)           [power-sum/moment face]
  Newton identities recover c_k from e_m=1/(2m+1)!.

