Carrier interpretation
  elementary face = disjoint packet counts, like OCF collections of disjoint odd cycles
  power-sum face  = moments/log-derivative, like scalar H or aggregate spectra
  Bernoulli face  = rational descent and p-adic/von-Staudt side-channel
  pi is the period that makes the elementary and power-sum faces agree.

