  hamiltonian_paths=1

Hypothesis
  Treat Basel identities as a period-carrier duality:
  disjoint elementary packets <-> power-sum moments <-> Bernoulli/p-adic sieve.
  This is the analytic cousin of the repo's OCF identity H(T)=I(Omega(T),2).
